# CocoaPods components consumed by the LynxExplorer that live outside
# this repository. Each line follows the format used by
# lynx/tools/ios_tools/prepare_cocoapods_sources.py:
#
#   <source_url>:<PodName>:<Version> pod [auto]
#
# The source URL matches a `source` declared in Podfile. For the CocoaPods
# trunk index the correct value is https://cdn.cocoapods.org/.
